GOLDEN RULE:
→ FIRST: ENCODING OR CRYPTO?
→ MOST CHALLS = BROKEN IMPLEMENTATION
→ LOOK FOR REUSE (key / nonce / randomness)
→ USE KNOWN PLAINTEXT ("flag{")

